# Way of the Healer (turn 1, off four Moxen): "When it enters, empower Jace 5": no Jace token is controlled, so a blue Jace planeswalker
# token with 0 loyalty is created and gets five loyalty counters. "Planeswalkers you control have '[-2]: Create a 2/2 colorless Wizard
# Soldier creature token named Cadet. Surveil 1.'" gives the token that ability beside its own two: activating it costs 2 loyalty (5 to
# 3), makes the Cadet (a colorless 2/2 token, Soldier and Wizard) and then surveils 1: the top card, Swamp, is put into the graveyard.

